# Everything both expect files forbid: a fault, a panic, a refusal, a
# countdown tick drawing more than its digits' slot, the fan
# failing, and anything derived from what was typed.
!cannot show frames
!MON|ERROR
!seL4(CPU
!panicked
!gave up
!fan: no temperature
!PWM1 is not counting
!refused
!rejected
!could not be shown
!ended: a fault
!out of service
!dropped so far
!over its rate
!the UI's ring is full
!countdown drawn with more
!display-stub: frame
!zqvj
!9081726354
